A '''sulfur spring''' is a [[feature]] consisting of a mound of [[sulfur]] on the surface of the [[Overworld]] above [[sulfur caves]], similar to how [[azalea tree]]s generate above [[lush caves]].

== Description ==
Sulfur springs generate only above [[sulfur caves]] on the surface in any overworld [[biome]]. They are small, volcano-shaped common features, mostly made of [[sulfur]] blocks with a pool of [[water]] at the top containing [[potent sulfur]] and [[magma block]]s.

They come in 10 variants across four sizes, with rarity increasing as size increases.

